# Expo Core

Read https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v56.0.0/ before writing code.

## Workflow

1. Analyze — read existing files first
2. Plan — list files and data flow; save to `docs/plans/`; wait for confirmation
3. Implement — small, focused changes
4. Review — network, font scaling, dark mode, background state

## Imports

Use the `@/` path alias for cross-module imports:

```tsx
// Good
import { useHealthCheck } from '@/hooks/useHealthCheck';

// Bad
import { useHealthCheck } from '../../../hooks/useHealthCheck';
```

## Git

Do not commit unless the user explicitly asks.
